# Line endings are LF everywhere, whatever the contributor's Git settings.
# A shell script or YAML file with Windows line endings breaks: the container
# would fail to start with "exec /app/entrypoint.prod.sh: no such file or
# directory" because the interpreter path ends in a carriage return.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
